Description: Common library for the Yoriito Vehicle API
 Provides the common library shared by the Yoriito Signal and Access APIs.
 It exposes its shared library and headers under /usr/lib/yoriito and
 /usr/include/yoriito. The package ships a DLT configuration that is registered
 via update-alternatives to avoid conflicting with the dlt-daemon package.
